text @[Кё]
text I decided to try my best... to forget about it...
sound B4F.aac
text @[Кё]
text But even so...
sound B4G.aac
text @[Кё]
text You're still... so kind to me...
text @[Томоя]
text ...
sound B4H.aac
text @[Кё]
text It's cruel, don't you think...?
sound B4I.aac
